{"cve": "CVE-2026-42284", "version": "N/A", "published": "2026-05-07T19:16:01.783", "lastModified": "2026-05-08T23:16:36.250", "description": "GitPython is a python library used to interact with Git repositories. Prior to version 3.1.47, _clone() validates multi_options as the original list, then executes shlex.split(\" \".join(multi_options)). A string like \"--branch main --config core.hooksPath=/x\" passes validation (starts with --branch), but after split becomes [\"--branch\", \"main\", \"--config\", \"core.hooksPath=/x\"]. Git applies the config and executes attacker hooks during clone. This issue has been patched in version 3.1.47.", "cvssScore": 8.1, "cvsseSeverity": "HIGH", "CWE": ["707", "74", "77", "88"], "CAPEC": ["13", "84", "76", "72", "3", "135", "279", "47", "136", "80", "174", "183", "7", "45", "75", "15", "278", "88", "83", "250", "28", "79", "10", "53", "24", "248", "42", "40", "276", "9", "34", "277", "105", "52", "41", "108", "64", "137", "8", "67", "78", "267", "71", "6", "14", "120", "51", "468", "273", "43", "460", "101", "46"], "TECHNIQUES": [{"id": "1027", "name": "ENTRY NAME", "tactics": []}, {"id": "1562.003", "name": "ENTRY NAME", "tactics": []}, {"id": "1574.006", "name": "ENTRY NAME", "tactics": []}, {"id": "1574.007", "name": "ENTRY NAME", "tactics": []}], "DEFEND": [{"id": "D3-FA", "tactic": "Detect", "technique": "File Analysis", "artifact": "File"}, {"id": "D3-FIM", "tactic": "Detect", "technique": "File Integrity Monitoring", "artifact": "File"}, {"id": "D3-DA", "tactic": "Detect", "technique": "Dynamic Analysis", "artifact": "Executable File"}, {"id": "D3-EFA", "tactic": "Detect", "technique": "Emulated File Analysis", "artifact": "Executable File"}, {"id": "D3-FEV", "tactic": "Evict", "technique": "File Eviction", "artifact": "File"}, {"id": "D3-DF", "tactic": "Deceive", "technique": "Decoy File", "artifact": "File"}, {"id": "D3-FE", "tactic": "Harden", "technique": "File Encryption", "artifact": "File"}, {"id": "D3-RF", "tactic